  "title": "Yummy Cheese Fries",
  "description": "This recipe for yummy cheese fries bakes fries in the oven with Cheddar and crumbled bacon and serves them with ranch dressing for a quick appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Quincie Ingram"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:49:50-04:00",
